{
  "$id": "https://campuspath.invalid/schema/ResumeUpload.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Resume 上传（2026-07-31 用户需求 A）。markdown/纯文本直接进\n``content_text``；PDF 走 ``content_base64``，由服务端抽取文本。\n\n上传**不直接写档案**：A1 从文本提炼出候选变更、生成一条恒为 pending 的\nProfileUpdateProposal（B3），与现有档案冲突的条目标为 update 并带\nold_value——由学生逐项决定是否更新为新版本。",
  "properties": {
    "content_base64": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 4000000,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "PDF 原文（base64）",
      "title": "Content Base64"
    },
    "content_text": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 100000,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Content Text"
    },
    "filename": {
      "maxLength": 255,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Filename",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "filename"
  ],
  "title": "ResumeUpload",
  "type": "object"
}
